  "question": {
    "text": "Among the following ores Bauxite, Siderite, Cuprite, Calamine, Haematite, Kaolinite, Malachite, Magnetite, Sphalerite, Limonite, Cryolite, the number of principal ores of iron is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Siderite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>FeCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>Malachite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CuCO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>.</mo><mi>Cu</mi><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p><p>Magnetite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math></p><p>Haematite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Fe</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math></p><p>Cryolite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mi>AlF</mi><mn>6</mn></msub></math></p><p>Cuprite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>Cu</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Limonite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>FeO</mi><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mo>.</mo><msub><mi>nH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Kaolinite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msub><mi>Al</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mn>4</mn></msub><msub><mi>Si</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>5</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Sphalerite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>ZnS</mi></math></p><p>Bauxite:&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>AlO</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msub><msub><mfenced><mi>OH</mi></mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msub></math></p><p>So, as we can see that among the given options 4 ores (Siderite, magnetite, Haematite, Limonite) contain iron.&nbsp;</p></blockquote>"
  }
